### PHASE 26: FRONT-END PARITY & NOTIFICATION AGGREGATION

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer <PROJECT_OWNER_JWT>
@collabToken = Bearer <COLLABORATOR_JWT>
@superuserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>

### 1. Suspend Collaborator with 8 Open Tasks -> 1 Grouped Owner Notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2/suspend
Authorization: {{superuserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Policy violation suspension to verify single grouped TASK_RELEASED notice."
}

### 2. Inspect Owner Grouped Notification (count, groupKey, items[])
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

### 3. Close Project with 5 Pending Requests -> 1 Applicant Notice Each + 1 Owner Summary
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/close
Authorization: {{superuserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Administrative closure with multiple pending requests"
}

### 4. Delete Collaborator Account Participating in Multiple Projects of Same Owner
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/delete
Authorization: {{collabToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arjun_sharma",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 5. Trigger Hourly Scheduled Jobs -> Grouped Per-Owner / Per-Recipient Reminders
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superuserToken}}
